-26T15:13:49.824Z","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/stephenking.bsky.social/post/3n37xm2ip2s2n","img":"","likes":267,"reposts":8,"replies":11,"text_ko":""},{"id":"b3n37xjhyzdk2n","net":"bluesky","name":"Stephen King","handle":"@stephenking.bsky.social","avatar":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:h7obn4tkp47wn7gqh4oe5eij/bafkreictz5mfmy5mz6s6orrdgsmx3nr4vgog4kie4gezhdx2nhn2irhski","cat":"문화","text":"Joe is a hard character to like.","t":"2026-11-26T15:12:23.327Z","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/stephenking.bsky.social/post/3n37xjhyzdk2n","img":"","likes":160,"reposts":3,"replies":6,"text_ko":""},{"id":"b3n37n45xpx226","net":"bluesky","name":"Stephen King","handle":"@stephenking.bsky.social","avatar":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:h7obn4tkp47wn7gqh4oe5eij/bafkreictz5mfmy5mz6s6orrdgsmx3nr4vgog4kie4gezhdx2nhn2irhski","cat":"문화","text":"LIONESS: Joe explains \"freedom\" to her girls, while they are living on an Army post due to threats on Joe's life, and the girls are being home schooled. In other words, their current situation turns her monologue about freedom into a bitter joke. I like the show but could do with less preaching.","t":"2026-11-26T12:05:59.173Z","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/stephenking.bsky.social/post/3n37n45xpx226","img":"","likes":512,"reposts":24,"replies":40,"text_ko":""},{"id":"b3n36dpgdokk22","net":"bluesky","name":"Barack Obama","handle":"@barackobama.bsky.social","avatar":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:5c6cw3veuqruljoy5ahzerfx/bafkreigzylod45x3ioqaiwc5fyqogk7yfivssea3qkgorsz3ed6wko46xq","cat":"정치","text":"Ahead of the holiday, Michelle and I got a chance to pack some boxes of food for families in need with the team at Dion’s Chicago Dream. \n\nWishing everyone celebrating tomorrow a wonderful Thanksgiving!","t":"2026-11-25T23:45:08.330Z","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/barackobama.bsky.social/post/3n36dpgdokk22","img":"","likes":11595,"reposts":1768,"replies":315,"text_ko":""},{"id":"b3n2tynzp4gs2t","